摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Claude Code integration plugin for DeepSeek Harness, providing native Claude conversations powered by the Claude Agent SDK, with approvals, session continuity, and DSH tool support.","id":"gh:1343529877","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"relay-dsh-plugin-claude","slug":"yangbobo2021/relay-dsh-plugin-claude","topics":["ai-agent","anthropic","claude-code","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","plugin","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Claude Code integration plugin for DeepSeek Harness, providing native Claude conversations powered b"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"y the Claude Agent SDK, with approvals, session continuity, and DSH tool support."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Claude Code Conversations for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **Stable `0.2.4` is verified on official DSH `0.1.5-rc.2` and `0.1.6-alpha.1`.** It preserves the "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"bound Claude Session when resume fails instead of creating a replacement, and its source peer metada"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ta declares both exact releases. Install it from npm · Compatibility evidence."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **Release channels:** `latest` → `0.2.4`; `next` → `0.2.5-rc.1`."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**npm package:** `relay-dsh-plugin-claude`\n· All Relay DSH plugins"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Run Claude Code inside official DeepSeek Harness without switching interfaces\nor maintaining a DSH"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"aude Code inside official DeepSeek Harness without switching interfaces\nor maintaining a DSH fork.**"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"`relay-dsh-plugin-claude` adds **Claude Code as a native conversation backend**\nto the official Deep"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"Seek Harness\n(DSH) Web UI. You keep DSH's workspace, conversation history, composer,\napprovals, ques"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"tions, and tool display while each DSH Session continues one\nClaude Agent SDK session. The plugin in"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"stalls independently; no Relay checkout\nis required."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Try It on Official DSH"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Complete normal Claude Code authentication with `claude` before the first\nSession. The install requi"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"res Node.js 22.13 or newer and `pnpm` on `PATH`. Then\nstop DSH Web, install the tested stable releas"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"r newer and `pnpm` on `PATH`. Then\nstop DSH Web, install the tested stable release, and restart DSH:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Open **New Session**, select a workspace, choose **Claude Code** from the mode\nmenu, and send a mess"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" **New Session**, select a workspace, choose **Claude Code** from the mode\nmenu, and send a message."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The screenshot was captured from official DSH `0.1.1-rc.2` with the Codex and\nClaude plugins install"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ed. If you install only this plugin, only **Claude Code**\nis added."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Review all Relay DSH plugins\n· report an install result"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"If this removes an interface switch from your DSH workflow,\nstar this plugin.\nThat signal helps othe"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"r DSH users find a tested Claude Code backend."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Do I Need This Plugin?"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Install it when you want to:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- use Claude Code inside DSH instead of switching to a separate Claude Code\ninterface;\n- keep DSH's "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"native conversation history, composer, approvals, questions, and\ntool presentation;\n- let one DSH Se"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ssion continue the same Claude Agent SDK session across turns;\n- use Claude models, reasoning, inter"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ruption, and DSH-contributed tools in the\nsame conversation."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"You do not need it to use DSH's standard agents. It also does not add Relay\nEvents, file browsing, o"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"r a terminal panel. Those are separate optional plugins."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Complete Setup and Compatibility"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The steps below were validated with:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.1-rc.2`, commit\n`b150a551`\n- Node.js 22.13 or newer\n- `pnpm` available on `P"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"epSeek Harness `0.1.1-rc.2`, commit\n`b150a551`\n- Node.js 22.13 or newer\n- `pnpm` available on `PATH`"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"DSH is currently a developer preview and may introduce compatibility-breaking\nchanges. This reposito"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ry tracks official releases and records its tested version\nhere."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### 1. Prepare Claude Code authentication"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The Claude Agent SDK is installed as a normal dependency of this plugin. Before\nstarting your first "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"DSH Claude session, complete normal local Claude Code setup\nand authentication for the user that wil"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" session, complete normal local Claude Code setup\nand authentication for the user that will run DSH."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Follow the official Claude Code setup documentation,\nthen start Claude Code once to verify that auth"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"entication succeeds:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Credentials stay under Claude Code's normal local authentication mechanism; this\nplugin does not col"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"s stay under Claude Code's normal local authentication mechanism; this\nplugin does not collect them."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### 2. Choose a package source and install"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Stop a running DSH Web process before changing Profile bundles. Choose one of\nthe following sources."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"#### Stable npm release"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"The published npm package name is\n`relay-dsh-plugin-claude`.\nUse `@latest` to install the current st"},{"id":"p33s2","text":" npm package name is\n`relay-dsh-plugin-claude`.\nUse `@latest` to install the current stable release:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"At the time of writing, `latest` resolves to stable version `0.2.4`. The linked\nnpm page is the sour"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ce of truth for the current version."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"#### npm prerelease (recommended during DSH preview)"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Use `@next` to try the newest release candidate that has passed the repository's\nCI publishing and o"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"fficial DSH compatibility checks. The current candidate also\ncontains the latest model-selection syn"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"tibility checks. The current candidate also\ncontains the latest model-selection synchronization fix:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"At the time of writing, `next` resolves to `0.2.5-rc.1`."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"#### GitHub development build"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Install the current `main` branch when testing an unreleased change:"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"`main` can change at any time. For a reproducible GitHub install, pin a Tag or\nfull Commit SHA inste"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"e at any time. For a reproducible GitHub install, pin a Tag or\nfull Commit SHA instead. For example:"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"The official DSH CLI initializes the `web` Profile if it does not exist, asks\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## What Works"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"- One persistent Claude Agent SDK session per DSH Session\n- Model and reasoning selection\n- Streamin"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"g answers and tool activity in the native DSH conversation\n- Image-and-text prompts through the defa"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"ult Claude Agent SDK backend\n- Durable in-conversation previews for workspace images referenced by C"},{"id":"p47s4","text":"laude's\nfinal answer\n- DSH approval and user-question flows\n- Interruption and session continuation\n"},{"id":"p47s5","text":"- Selective import and exact-ID continuation of existing Claude terminal Sessions\n- Generic DSH tool"},{"id":"p47s6","text":"s exposed through an in-process Claude SDK MCP server\n- Dedicated native Claude `Glob` and `Grep` se"},{"id":"p47s7","text":"arch tools on every SDK query\n- Pre-persistence redaction of sensitive environment values from tool "},{"id":"p47s8","text":"ools on every SDK query\n- Pre-persistence redaction of sensitive environment values from tool output"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
